type State struct { Users map[string]*User `json:"users"`; Types map[string]*SampleType `json:"types"`; Locations map[string]*Location `json:"locations"`; Connections map[string]*Connection `json:"connections"`; Samples map[string]*Sample `json:"samples"`; Journeys map[string]*Journey `json:"journeys"`; Assignments map[string]*Assignment `json:"assignments"`; Handoffs map[string]*Handoff `json:"handoffs"`; Audit []Event `json:"audit"`; NextEvent int `json:"nextEvent"`; Sessions map[string]string `json:"sessions"`; Idempotency map[string]interface{} `json:"idempotency"` }
type App struct { mu sync.Mutex; state State; file string }

func uid() string { b:=make([]byte,16); rand.Read(b); return fmt.Sprintf("%s-%s-4%s-8%s-%s",hex.EncodeToString(b[:4]),hex.EncodeToString(b[4:6]),hex.EncodeToString(b[6:8]),hex.EncodeToString(b[8:10]),hex.EncodeToString(b[10:])) }
func now() string { return time.Now().UTC().Format(time.RFC3339) }
func main(){ a:=&App{file:os.Getenv("STATE_FILE")}; if a.file=="" { a.file="/workspace/data/state.json" }; a.load(); a.seedAdmin(); mux:=http.NewServeMux(); mux.HandleFunc("/ready",a.ready); mux.HandleFunc("/api/",a.api); mux.HandleFunc("/",a.web); fmt.Println("Lab pickup listening on 127.0.0.1:8080"); http.ListenAndServe("127.0.0.1:8080",mux) }
func empty() State { return State{map[string]*User{},map[string]*SampleType{},map[string]*Location{},map[string]*Connection{},map[string]*Sample{},map[string]*Journey{},map[string]*Assignment{},map[string]*Handoff{},[]Event{},1,map[string]string{},map[string]interface{}{}} }
func (a *App) load(){ a.state=empty(); b,e:=os.ReadFile(a.file); if e==nil { json.Unmarshal(b,&a.state) }; if a.state.Users==nil { a.state=empty() } }
func (a *App) save(){ os.MkdirAll(filepath.Dir(a.file),0755); b,_:=json.MarshalIndent(a.state,"","  "); os.WriteFile(a.file,b,0600) }
func (a *App) seedAdmin(){ a.mu.Lock(); defer a.mu.Unlock(); if len(a.state.Users)>0{return}; un,pw:=os.Getenv("ADMIN_USERNAME"),os.Getenv("ADMIN_PASSWORD"); if un=="" {un="admin"};if pw=="" {pw="admin"}; u:=&User{ID:uid(),Username:un,Password:pw,FullName:"System Administrator",Roles:[]string{"administrator","dispatcher"},Active:true,Available:true,CapacityUnits:1}; a.state.Users[u.ID]=u; for _, x:=range []struct{name,container string;min,max float64; cool,batch bool}{{"Amber","standard",2,25,false,true},{"Indigo","indigo",2,25,false,true},{"Frost","cooled",2,8,true,true},{"Pulse","standard",2,25,false,false}} { id:=uid(); a.state.Types[id]=&SampleType{ID:id,Name:x.name,Qualified:true,Qualification:x.name,Container:x.container,Min:x.min,Max:x.max,Cooled:x.cool,Batching:x.batch,Incompatible:[]string{}} }; a.audit(u,"administrator","bootstrap","system","initialization",true,map[string]interface{}{}); a.save() }
func (a *App) audit(u *User, role, action, typ,id string, success bool, d map[string]interface{}) Event { e:=Event{a.state.NextEvent,action,"",role,typ,id,success,now(),d};a.state.NextEvent++;if u!=nil{e.Actor=u.ID};a.state.Audit=append(a.state.Audit,e); return e }
func respond(w http.ResponseWriter,status int,v interface{}){w.Header().Set("Content-Type","application/json");w.WriteHeader(status);json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(v)}
func err(w http.ResponseWriter,s int,code,msg string){respond(w,s,map[string]string{"error":msg,"code":code})}
func decode(w http.ResponseWriter,r *http.Request) (map[string]interface{},bool){ defer r.Body.Close(); var v map[string]interface{}; if json.NewDecoder(io.LimitReader(r.Body,1<<20)).Decode(&v)!=nil {err(w,400,"invalid_request","Invalid JSON request body");return nil,false}; return v,true }
func str(v map[string]interface{},k string)string{x,_:=v[k].(string);return x};func boolv(v map[string]interface{},k string)bool{x,_:=v[k].(bool);return x};func num(v map[string]interface{},k string)float64{x,_:=v[k].(float64);return x};func intv(v map[string]interface{},k string)int{return int(num(v,k))}
func coord(v interface{})(Coord,bool){m,ok:=v.(map[string]interface{});if !ok{return Coord{},false};lat,lo:=m["latitude"].(float64),m["longitude"].(float64); if lat < -90||lat>90||lo < -180||lo>180{return Coord{},false};return Coord{lat,lo},true}
func stringsV(v interface{})[]string { arr,_:=v.([]interface{});out:=[]string{};for _,x:=range arr{if s,ok:=x.(string);ok{out=append(out,s)}};return out }
func (a *App) auth(w http.ResponseWriter,r *http.Request, roles ...string)(*User,string,bool){ h:=strings.TrimPrefix(r.Header.Get("Authorization"),"Bearer ");if h==""{h=r.Header.Get("X-Session-Token")}; id:=a.state.Sessions[h];u:=a.state.Users[id];if u==nil||!u.Active {err(w,401,"unauthenticated","Authentication required");return nil,"",false};role:=r.Header.Get("X-Active-Role");if role=="" {role=u.Roles[0]}; found:=false;for _,x:=range u.Roles{if x==role{found=true}};if !found {err(w,403,"role_not_held","Selected role is not held by this user");return nil,"",false};if len(roles)>0 {ok:=false;for _,z:=range roles{if role==z || role=="administrator"{ok=true}};if !ok {a.audit(u,role,"permission_denied","api",r.URL.Path,false,map[string]interface{}{});a.save();err(w,403,"forbidden","Selected role cannot perform this action");return nil,"",false}};return u,role,true }
EOF

